{"type":"text","timestamp":1788998440477,"sessionID":"ses_f77642085ffeC3WrcH4De1u9FV","part":{"id":"prt_0889dd0ec001K6XivUo4EE9v7h","messageID":"msg_0889dcc7c001yQln0ZRLCCMQz2","sessionID":"ses_f77642085ffeC3WrcH4De1u9FV","type":"text","text":"Good — that matches spec exactly: `n when n < 5` rebinds `n`, so `rebinding` is correct even though the dir is named \"guarded\". All 13 cases now align with the directory-name hints and the spec's worked examples.","time":{"start":1788998439148,"end":1788998440469}}}
